Description:

CalendarEvent/set now sets organizerCalendarAddress when an update adds
participants to an event that had none, as JMAP Calendars requires.  Creating
an event also sets it if the first participant has no calendarAddress.
Participants with a calendarAddress in a recurrence override are rejected
unless the main event has an organizerCalendarAddress.


